all individuals:\n- not_orderable: ravioli\n- orderable: peach, lobster\n\nThis final combination should satisfy all individuals because:\n- Everyone who dislikes ravioli is satisfied by it being 'not_orderable'.\n- Everyone else is satisfied by at least one item from peach or lobster being on the 'orderable' list.\n\nHere is the output in Python code:\n\n```python\norderable=['peach', 'lobster'], not_orderable=['ravioli']\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 892, 'num_completion_tokens': 1358}
