he criteria for an orderable and not_orderable list that satisfies all parties, as interests are directly conflicting.\n\nThus, the final solution is:\n`orderable=[]`, `not_orderable=[]`\n\nThis structure suggests that no combination of orderable and not_orderable food items exists that would satisfy every person's preferences as per the given satisfaction criteria.", 'num_prompt_tokens': 1612, 'num_completion_tokens': 495}
