likes and dislikes means there's no configuration that can satisfy everyone simultaneously.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that both lists must be empty. Here is the final solution:\n\n```\norderable=[], not_orderable=[]\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 743, 'num_completion_tokens': 805}
