the 70 individuals, it\'s improbable to construct two lists that meet all the satisfaction criteria without further constraints or preferences. The task, as it stands, is likely unsolvable and requires empty lists for both "orderable" and "not_orderable". Hence, no combination can satisfy all individuals.\n\nHere\'s the code for empty lists:\n\n```python\norderable = []\nnot_orderable = []\n```', 'num_prompt_tokens': 1343, 'num_completion_tokens': 1461}
