 simple heuristic methods alone, and an exhaustive search seems necessary.\n\nSince the exhaustive search is beyond the scope here, we'd have to stop and acknowledge that without further computational tools or more time to process the combinations, we cannot come up with a satisfactory set of 'orderable' and 'not_orderable' lists for such a complex problem.\n\nSo, the output lists based on the given preferences and constraints would be:\n\n```python\norderable=[], not_orderable=[]\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 943, 'num_completion_tokens': 842}
