lad 'orderable'.\n- Nic dislikes caramel and korma but is satisfied with salad 'orderable'.\n\nAll individuals are now satisfied with the current lists. We have successfully created lists where at least one liked item is 'orderable' or one disliked item is 'not_orderable' for each person. No items appear on both lists, and all participants are satisfied by this combination.\n\nThus, the solution is:\n\norderable = ['salad', 'korma']\nnot_orderable = ['falafel']", 'num_prompt_tokens': 414, 'num_completion_tokens': 887}
