 the 'orderable' list and curry on the 'not_orderable' list, everyone's preferences are met by at least one condition.\n\nNo other commonly disliked food needs to be added to the 'not_orderable' list as 'curry' already satisfies all participants with a dislike. Similarly, no other liked food needs to be added as 'pizza' satisfies all other individuals who were not satisfied with 'curry' being 'not_orderable'.\n\nHere's the final output:\n\n```python\norderable=['pizza'], not_orderable=['curry']\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 886, 'num_completion_tokens': 843}
