es and dislikes.\n\nTherefore, there is no combination that can satisfy all participants based on the given criteria, and the outcome is that we have no 'orderable' or 'not_orderable' items that will satisfy everyone.\n\nThe final solution for this configuration is:\n```python\norderable=[], not_orderable=[]\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 662, 'num_completion_tokens': 1113}
