e liked by at least one individual.\n\nAt this point, it seems we have an impasse. Every food item is either liked or disliked by someone, preventing us from constructing two lists that will meet everyone\'s satisfaction according to the criteria. Since we can\'t satisfy everyone with the current choices, we must output empty lists for both "orderable" and "not_orderable":\n\n```python\norderable = [], not_orderable = []\n```', 'num_prompt_tokens': 380, 'num_completion_tokens': 856}
