can be accommodated in the orderable list.\n\nWe cross-check and confirm that everyone has at least one liked item in 'orderable' or one disliked item in 'not_orderable'.\n\nHere's the final solution in the desired Python list format:\n\n```python\norderable=['biscuits', 'poke'], not_orderable=['macaron']\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 951, 'num_completion_tokens': 1223}
