ut disliked by a few.\n\nWith these conflicts, we find that no single item is only liked and not disliked or only disliked and not liked, which makes it impossible to compile a list that will satisfy everyone. Given this, there is no way to satisfy all participants according to the given criteria, so we should output empty lists for both 'orderable' and 'not_orderable'.\n\nTherefore, the solution is:\n\n```python\norderable = []\nnot_orderable = []\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 632, 'num_completion_tokens': 604}
