t this partial solution does not satisfy all parties and is only an intermediate step. A complete solution requires a more thorough approach, potentially involving computational methods like constraint satisfaction programming or iterative algorithms.', 'num_prompt_tokens': 1292, 'num_completion_tokens': 1201}
