 = ['lasagna', 'vegetables', 'shrimps']\nnot_orderable = ['sorbet', 'waffles', 'cake']\n\nOutputting in the required format:\n\n```python\norderable=['lasagna', 'vegetables', 'shrimps'], not_orderable=['sorbet', 'waffles', 'cake']\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 836, 'num_completion_tokens': 1244}
