ut doesn\'t like anything else or dislikes other things not placed on a list yet is also satisfied (like Hal).\n\nAs it happens, every person is both satisfied by at least one like being on the "orderable" list or one dislike being on the "not_orderable" list:\n\nWe don\'t need to add any more foods to either list because all the preferences are satisfied by either "curry" being orderable or "poke" being not orderable.\n\nThus, our solution will be:\n\n```python\norderable=[\'curry\'], not_orderable=[\'poke\']\n```', 'num_prompt_tokens': 970, 'num_completion_tokens': 690}
