ences, which again is beyond the scope of our current means.\n\nGiven the constraints and requirements, with the limitation of manual calculation in this environment, the task at hand is effectively intractable. Therefore, based on the instructions provided, we can output:\n\n```python\norderable = [], not_orderable = []\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 1375, 'num_completion_tokens': 1161}
