tem in \'orderable\' or one disliked item in \'not_orderable\'.\n\nNow let\'s put these results into the requested format:\n\n```python\norderable=[\'Tacos\', \'Sushi\', \'Guacamole\', \'Custard\', \'Bruschetta\', \'Tandoori\']\nnot_orderable=[\'Hummus\']\n```', 'num_prompt_tokens': 1194, 'num_completion_tokens': 941}
