ogramming or constraint satisfaction problem (CSP) solver to handle the complex interdependencies.\n\nUnfortunately, without automating this process, it is unfeasible to provide an accurate answer within a reasonable time frame due to the sheer number of permutations and combinations to consider.\n\nTherefore, based on manual computation alone and the complexity of provided preferences, it is not feasible to produce the two lists within the scope of this platform. Instead, this would be a task best tackled with a computer algorithm designed for CSPs.', 'num_prompt_tokens': 717, 'num_completion_tokens': 925}
