a: Likes burrito, quiche. Dislikes doughnut. Neil: Likes pie, doughnut. Dislikes fries. Kim: Likes pie, peach. Dislikes mousse. Joe: Likes pie. Dislikes burrito, peach. Arun: Dislikes mousse, peach, burrito. Ada: Likes mousse. Dislikes peach, pie. Hal: Likes peach, doughnut. Dislikes burrito. Min: Likes burrito, mousse, peach. Jaya: Likes doughnut. Dislikes burrito, pie. Lin: Likes pie, burrito. Dislikes mousse. Om: Likes mousse, doughnut. Dislikes fries. Joy: Likes pie, quiche. Dislikes doughnut. Lan: Likes peach. Dislikes burrito, mousse. Mei: Likes doughnut. Dislikes mousse, peach. Lee: Likes pie. Dislikes quiche, burrito. Pat: Likes quiche. Dislikes mousse, peach. Nita: Likes peach, pie. Dislikes doughnut. Ansh: Likes mousse, pie. Dislikes burrito. Mina: Likes mousse, fries, pie. Gia: Likes burrito. Dislikes peach, doughnut. Lou: Likes burrito, quiche. Dislikes pie. Taj: Likes burrito. Dislikes peach, doughnut. Qi: Likes pie. Dislikes mousse, doughnut. Cal: Likes doughnut. Dislikes mousse, burrito. Xiu: Dislikes peach, mousse, fries. Ula: Likes mousse, fries. Dislikes burrito. Dot: Likes peach, mousse, burrito. Jay: Likes pie. Dislikes quiche, fries. Sam: Dislikes quiche, burrito, peach. Zara: Likes quiche. Dislikes doughnut, pie. Ru: Dislikes peach, burrito, mousse. Ravi: Likes burrito. Dislikes peach, quiche. Kai: Dislikes doughnut, mousse, quiche. Hui: Likes pie, fries. Dislikes burrito. Veer: Dislikes burrito, doughnut, peach. Bo: Likes doughnut, peach, quiche. Leo: Likes burrito, mousse. Dislikes quiche. Kit: Likes mousse. Dislikes doughnut, fries. Kavi: Likes doughnut, mousse. Dislikes fries. Ron: Likes burrito. Dislikes peach, doughnut. Hu: Likes burrito. Dislikes fries, pie. Val: Likes fries, doughnut. Dislikes mousse. Ken: Likes doughnut. Dislikes pie, mousse. May: Dislikes quiche, fries, pie. Zoe: Likes doughnut, fries. Dislikes mousse. ', 'menu_items': ['fries', 'doughnut', 'pie', 'mousse', 'burrito', 'quiche', 'peach'], 'gpt_out': "In order to solve 