ble' list.\n- For those individuals who dislike waffles, they have other food preferences met either by including waffles in 'orderable' or bruschetta in 'not_orderable'.\n\nSince waffles and bruschetta don't conflict with anyone’s satisfaction condition, the lists would be:\n\norderable = ['waffles']\nnot_orderable = ['bruschetta']\n\nWe have not identified any insurmountable conflicts with this arrangement. It seem to meet the satisfaction criteria for everyone involved, thus we're going to output these lists.\n\n```python\norderable=['waffles'], not_orderable=['bruschetta']\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 1092, 'num_completion_tokens': 1074}
