ory combination for these two. Thus, it's impossible to satisfy all participants. We can conclude that there is no combination that satisfies all participants and output empty lists for both 'orderable' and 'not_orderable'.\n\nThe final solution is:\n```python\norderable = [], not_orderable = []\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 513, 'num_completion_tokens': 158}
