o but dislikes naan and roti, cannot decide yet.\n- Tim dislikes risotto but likes naan, this is a conflict because naan is not_orderable, Tim can't be satisfied. So we have a situation where no combination can satisfy all the participants.\n\nSince Tim cannot be satisfied with the current lists and we must satisfy everyone, we conclude with:\n\norderable = []\nnot_orderable = []\n\nNo combination exists that satisfies everyone's food preferences.", 'num_prompt_tokens': 760, 'num_completion_tokens': 928}
