most acceptable 'orderable' and 'not_orderable' items that will satisfy all participants, we arrive at our final solution:\n- orderable: Guacamole, Fries\n- not_orderable: Salmon\n\nThe final output in Python code syntax is:\n```python\norderable=['guacamole', 'fries'], not_orderable=['salmon']\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 576, 'num_completion_tokens': 1123}
