d.\n**Jay**: Likes shawarma (not_orderable), satisfied.\n**Anil**: Likes shrimps (orderable), satisfied.\n**Yue**: Dislikes shawarma (not_orderable), satisfied.\n**Ian**: Likes falafel and shrimps (orderable), satisfied.\n\nIt seems like all participants are satisfied with this combination, so we have our solution:\n\n```python\norderable=["falafel", "vegetables", "naan", "shrimps"], not_orderable=["shawarma", "roti", "couscous"]\n```', 'num_prompt_tokens': 628, 'num_completion_tokens': 1201}
