not_orderable'. No conflicts arise with this choice, as there is no individual for whom peach is their sole dislike and fries is their sole like.\n\nHence, our lists will be:\n\n```python\norderable=['peach'], not_orderable=['fries']\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 1111, 'num_completion_tokens': 888}
