pping dislikes with the other's likes on all food items. For example, Hu's dislike of ratatouille clashes with Dan, Mia, and others who like it, while others' dislikes for caramel complicates putting it in 'orderable' given Ying's dislike.\n\nAs we have not been able to find a combination that satisfies all participants according to the criteria, the output is:\n\n```python\norderable=[], not_orderable=[]\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 621, 'num_completion_tokens': 1147}
