g to Zan, Sue, Mei, and Yue's satisfaction.\n\nNow, let's summarize as final lists:\n\norderable: baklava, toast, sorbet, pancakes\nnot_orderable: korma, lasagna\n\nWith these lists, we satisfy everyone:\n\n- Joe is satisfied with baklava and sorbet.\n- Bo is satisfied with baklava and sorbet (korma is not orderable).\n- Ivy is satisfied with sorbet and toast.\n- Shan is satisfied with toast (baklava and korma are not in the same list).\n- Kit is satisfied with lasagna not orderable.\n- Dan is satisfied with baklava (korma is not orderable).\n- Jan is satisfied with lasagna not orderable (korma is not orderable).\n- Pat is satisfied with toast.\n- Val is satisfied with sorbet (lasagna and korma are not orderable).\n- Qi is satisfied with toast and pancakes.\n- Arun is satisfied with korma and baklava not orderable.\n- Rina is satisfied with toast.\n- Jun is satisfied with baklava (korma is not orderable).\n- Zan is satisfied with toast and pancakes.\n- Wes is satisfied with baklava and pancakes.\n- Vic is satisfied with toast and sorbet (korma is not orderable).\n- Kavi is satisfied with lasagna not orderable.\n- Yue is satisfied as toast is orderable, and pancakes and lasagna are not in the same list (she dislikes all three).\n- Hui is satisfied with lasagna not orderable (korma is not orderable).\n- Mei is satisfied with pancakes.\n- Pia is satisfied with toast.\n- Rex is satisfied with sorbet.\n- Lex is satisfied with baklava.\n- Ava is okay since korma is not orderable.\n- Lan is satisfied with toast.\n- Fay is okay since korma is not orderable.\n- Jim is satisfied with baklava and toast.\n- Ben is satisfied with toast and pancakes.\n- Sue is satisfied with toast and pancakes.\n- Jaya is okay since korma, lasagna, and toast are not in the same list.\n\nThe final lists are:\n```python\norderable=['baklava', 'toast', 'sorbet', 'pancakes'], not_orderable=['korma', 'lasagna']\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 601, 'num_completion_tokens': 1659}
