nflicting Food Items\nWe need to find food items that are both liked and disliked amongst the group since these items will be the most difficult to place on either 'orderable' or 'not_orderable' lists.\n\n- Udon is liked by Dot, Leo, Naina, Ned, Fay, Rob, Gia, Pia, Zan, Lex, Ana, Bo, Liv but disliked by Chao, Oli, Cy, Shan, Sol, Geet, Ava, Val, Kit. Udon is contentious and likely cannot be on the 'orderable' list due to dislikes.\n- Tiramisu is liked by Dan, Ada, Ula, Ru, Meg but disliked by Dot, Ravi, Joe, Sol, Min, Jan. Tiramisu is contentious and likely cannot be on the 'orderable' list due to dislikes.\n- Ramen is liked by Leo, Joe, Xan, Jan, Bao, Amy, Lex, Ana, Liv, Meg but disliked by Chao, Oli, Naina, Raj, Mel, Hui, Min, Joy, Mei. Ramen is contentious and likely cannot be on the 'orderable' list because of dislikes.\n- Burger is liked by many but disliked by Xan, Ravi, Sia, Geet, Gen, Zan, Ava, Li, Shan, Jaya, Lia. Burger is a common like but has strong dislikes, therefore it can't be on the 'orderable' list.\n- Poke is liked by Leo, Taj, Tara, Joy, Riya, Hal, Isha but disliked by Chao, Pam, Sia, Tia, Sol, Sam, Min, Kit, Val, Jan, Liv. Poke has many dislikes, likely not 'orderable'.\n- Nachos are liked by Chao, Sia, Jay, Tia, Jaya, Geet, Yan but disliked by Lia, Gen, Hui, Riya, Lex. Similar to the others, this is contentious.\n- Shrimps are liked by many but disliked by Tara, Pam, Taj, Jim, Joe, Pia, Hui, Ava, Meg. This is also contentious.\n- Toast is liked by many but disliked by Naina, Cy, Ned, Mel, Pam, Raj, Ava, Li. Due to these dislikes, likely not 'orderable'.\n- Lasagna is liked by Ravi, Fay, Tara, Chen, Isha, Mei, Eva, Ana, Liv but disliked by Dot, Sia, Pam, Fay, Gen, Meg, Joe, Ru. Disliked enough to not be 'orderable'.\n\nStep 2: Identify Non-Conflicting Food Items\nWe should identify items that are only liked but not disliked or only disliked but not liked as they are easier to sort into the lists.\n\n- Looking through the list, it seems that every