vided preferences, the output should be empty lists for both 'orderable' and 'not_orderable'.\n\nPython Code:\n\n```python\norderable = []\nnot_orderable = []\n``` \n\nThis represents that no solution exists to satisfy all participants.", 'num_prompt_tokens': 1046, 'num_completion_tokens': 1116}
