ers who dislike it. There\'s no single food item that is either liked by at least one person and not disliked by anyone or disliked by at least one person and not liked by anyone.\n\nAs there\'s no such combination that satisfies all participants, we output empty lists for both.\n\nPython code with the solution:\n```python\norderable = []\nnot_orderable = []\n```', 'num_prompt_tokens': 639, 'num_completion_tokens': 489}
