ikes lasagna. Dislikes macaron, falafel. Ava: Likes lasagna, bruschetta. Dislikes couscous. Val: Likes couscous, macaron. Dislikes ravioli. Min: Likes lasagna, couscous. Dislikes paneer. Liz: Likes frittata. Dislikes shrimps, ravioli. Bea: Likes paneer. Dislikes bruschetta, shrimps. Kavi: Likes lasagna. Dislikes paneer, wonton. Jaya: Likes ravioli. Dislikes couscous, wonton. Naina: Likes ravioli, shrimps. Dislikes lasagna. Pam: Likes couscous, bruschetta. Dislikes ravioli. Mel: Dislikes wonton, frittata, macaron. Chao: Dislikes falafel, wonton, ravioli. Kit: Likes wonton, frittata. Dislikes shrimps. Chen: Likes ravioli. Dislikes bruschetta, couscous. Eva: Likes lasagna. Dislikes couscous, ravioli. Arun: Dislikes wonton, lasagna, shrimps. Abe: Likes couscous, ravioli, falafel. Tao: Likes shrimps, wonton, bruschetta. Xan: Likes bruschetta, ravioli, frittata. Meg: Likes macaron, shrimps. Dislikes falafel. Fay: Likes ravioli. Dislikes bruschetta, frittata. Ty: Likes macaron, shrimps. Dislikes couscous. Sue: Likes macaron. Dislikes shrimps, lasagna. Aarav: Likes bruschetta, frittata. Dislikes macaron. Rob: Likes wonton, lasagna, couscous. Ula: Likes wonton, shrimps, couscous. Diya: Dislikes lasagna, wonton, couscous. Zara: Likes falafel. Dislikes lasagna, paneer. Feng: Dislikes lasagna, frittata, bruschetta. Dan: Likes wonton, macaron. Dislikes frittata. Om: Likes falafel, macaron, bruschetta. Mina: Likes couscous. Dislikes ravioli, wonton. Leo: Likes paneer, falafel. Dislikes frittata. Wes: Likes paneer. Dislikes couscous, frittata. Jun: Likes bruschetta. Dislikes lasagna, couscous. Ana: Likes paneer. Dislikes lasagna, wonton. Ravi: Likes shrimps. Dislikes frittata, lasagna. Hui: Likes ravioli. Dislikes bruschetta, couscous. Tom: Likes wonton, shrimps. Dislikes bruschetta. Zac: Likes falafel. Dislikes macaron, shrimps. Sky: Likes couscous, paneer. Dislikes falafel. Wei: Likes paneer. Dislikes couscous, frittata. Du: Dislikes wonton, macaron, bruschetta. Geet: Dislikes s