isfied people who don\'t like ramen by putting it into `not_orderable`. Therefore, neither hummus nor curry needs to be in the `not_orderable` list.\n\n6. Now that everyone’s preferences are met with these two choices, we can finalize our lists:\n\n`orderable = ["curry"]`\n`not_orderable = ["ramen"]`\n\nLet\'s format the result as python code: \n\n```python\norderable=[\'curry\'], not_orderable=[\'ramen\']\n```', 'num_prompt_tokens': 614, 'num_completion_tokens': 718}
