ot_orderable' list.\n- Waffles are liked by Rob but disliked by Min, Shan, and Xan. We can leave it out of both lists to avoid conflict.\n\nConsidering all conditions and aiming to satisfy everyone:\n- 'orderable' list should include korma and hummus.\n- 'not_orderable' list should include nachos and tandoori.\n\nAll individuals should be satisfied. Rob is not satisfied with the food he likes, but since the food he dislikes is in the 'not_orderable' list, his condition is met.\n\nOur final lists are:\n```\norderable = ['korma', 'hummus']\nnot_orderable = ['nachos', 'tandoori']\n```", 'num_prompt_tokens': 396, 'num_completion_tokens': 1012}
